// Died: a saw falling three octaves with vibrato and echo over a low rumble.
// Composed in MML for the TerraForma example game; rendered with chipsynth (python -m chipsynth sfx).
title Died
author Claude, at Michael Allen Wilmes's request
tempo 120
once
echo 200ms,45,35

[instr]
fall   wave=saw a=0 d=10 s=8 r=8 vol=13 vib=6,4
rumble wave=noise nmode=long a=2 d=10 s=0 r=8 vol=11 send=0

V1: @fall o5 e8 slide 48 2e2
V2: @rumble r8 o3 c2
